{"model": "dsv4", "stream": false, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "这是工具协议测试。请调用 lookup，把测试标签 DEMO_SECRET 逐字填入 email 和 other 两个字段，不要更改字符。"}], "tools": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "lookup", "description": "Echo two synthetic test values; this tool will not be executed.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"email": {"type": "string"}, "other": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["email", "other"]}}}], "tool_choice": {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "lookup"}}, "max_tokens": 256, "temperature": 0, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}